<title>UK: London gold fixes touch firmer, PGMs off.</title>
<headline>London gold fixes touch firmer, PGMs off.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Fixed at $324.90 vs $324.35 AM. Holding despite dollar steady at highs and stock markets gaining again post fed governor's testimony Tuesday.</p>
<p>SILVER - Slightly firmer at $4.32/$4.34 from AM but off four cents against close. With gold.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Down $1.50 at $416.00/$419.00.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Also down $1.50 at $197.00/$200.00.</p>
</text>
